CCL
	.VE/E			Lists versions of all the CUSPS too

See comments in the source file for information regarding other features.

&HELP

This version of HELP.SV was designed for use with the LAB-FOCAL script file.
The files required for its full use are HELP.HL and LDF.HL.  By default all
text comes from HELP.HL, hence normal use of the .HELP command is unchanged.

The scriptault is NO FORMFEED and NO TAB, which allows the TV12E or ASR33 hand-
lers to be used for output.
